  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '289adc99-0a65-48fc-82ac-0bbbc000b660', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$What specific emotional and social benefits did the student derive from their act of organizing the fundraiser?$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-949Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '9fbe9834-2dc7-4214-a7b2-3541ed3a2be4', NULL, 3),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '289adc99-0a65-48fc-82ac-0bbbc000b660', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the pedagogical value of integrating personal reflection activities with literary analysis in fostering character development.$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-949Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '9fbe9834-2dc7-4214-a7b2-3541ed3a2be4', NULL, 4),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '289adc99-0a65-48fc-82ac-0bbbc000b660', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Propose three actionable strategies a school community could implement to further encourage the spirit of giving and support, drawing inspiration from the provided text.$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-949Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '9fbe9834-2dc7-4214-a7b2-3541ed3a2be4', NULL, 5),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '289adc99-0a65-48fc-82ac-0bbbc000b660', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the concept of "community support" manifest in both the student's experience and the broader message of the poem?$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-949Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '9fbe9834-2dc7-4214-a7b2-3541ed3a2be4', NULL, 6),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '289adc99-0a65-48fc-82ac-0bbbc000b660', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$If the student were to present their experience to peers, what key takeaways about empathy and action might they emphasize?$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-949Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '9fbe9834-2dc7-4214-a7b2-3541ed3a2be4', NULL, 7),
